    <string name="set_about">About</string>
    <string name="set_method">Keeper puts four well-tested ideas from CBT and ACT on the water: naming a thought to step back from it (defusion), postponing worry to a set time each day, checking forecasts against what happened, and decatastrophising down to a plan.</string>
    <string name="set_not_therapy">It doesn\'t replace therapy. If thoughts are getting in the way of work, sleep or people, a CBT therapist can help. With intrusive thoughts and checking, ask about exposure and response prevention.</string>
    <string name="set_privacy">No account, no cloud, no analytics, no internet permission. Everything stays on the phone.</string>

